    {
      "uid": "zhcn:054c09a7d2866e59d4c92f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，最让我心动的还是比赛之后的胜者舞台！\r\n她们奔跑时所绽放的光芒，在聚光灯之下显得更加耀眼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a228f48c5779c5a7e794913a3dfde6d0dad701c900336c5f8726153ea51b45a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046003.json",
      "json_path": [
