    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5772b6ccdfaf47f2bf6c632d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总有一天……只要坚持不懈地一直努力，总有一天……\r\n我就是一直这样相信着自己，不顾一切地努力前进着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "50e536f105759c9a9a9b963c6df19abc71ddda4b454a5bf093a0418c92b94c65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046003.json",
      "json_path": [
