    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb448f9069cbf4306a104837",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，这意思当然不是准备放弃了哦！\r\n对飞鹰子来说，顶尖马娘偶像是绝对要实现的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ffff1a92acbe4455d95ca523dec8a26ab44ad1504391d09267b0848108351b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d17f3e6f03cf1d30b2442801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挑战沙土跑道正是你的机会哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff73f7ae64d991260db31856f0e091f43bb105fec16d1baec20aaaccdbe0691c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
