    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad34171c933e434b6e8d8ec8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过今天……总觉得，这个梦想格外遥远。\r\n大概是因为小铃鹿实在是厉害过头了吧……嘿嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "559a1c604810c54b2b5b633c1b4f7d3799e798b0208394b2e962814d986ff839",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
