    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46131e7e4798ce7bc3aa0541",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嗯，说得也是呢。\r\n其实这些事情我早就明白的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5cda8e9e0cb4d0af249e83dca97d64a4f3a6a3bf2504dd718dee8131a84e4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
