    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89e97ef782ec62d3f8e2cad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从入学以来，老师已经劝过我很多次要转去沙土跑道了。\r\n大家都说沙土跑道“更适合”我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2c1164f58ac0f88ed35afc4fe041c448b13d44823001f22f43b3c8b334ce954",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1046/storytimeline_041046003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
